# LeakSanitizer suppressions for `make memcheck` / the asan test preset.
# A leak whose stack is in omatrack source (other than the names below) is a bug.

# QObject that has lived on a worker thread cannot be destroyed after that
# thread has stopped (RemoteCache.cpp). One NetworkIo and one CacheIndex per
# connection, process lifetime.
leak:cacheIndexFor
leak:NetworkIo::instance

# Qt Quick ListView attached-property cache in offscreen QTest fixtures.
leak:qmlAttachedPropertiesObject
